{"id":"1f34094449d2996c","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-prob3-tight-family.md","title":"ZFC Prob3 Tight Family","display":"df-zfc-prob3-tight-family — ZFC Prob3 Tight Family","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-prob3-tight-family","aliases":["58-df-zfc-prob3-tight-family"],"display":"df-zfc-prob3-tight-family — ZFC Prob3 Tight Family","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-compact]]","[[58-df-zfc-measure6-probability-measure]]","[[58-df-zfc-prob3-weak-convergence]]","[[../batch14/58-df-topology.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-prob3-tight-family"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-prob3-tight-family</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-prob3-tight-family — ZFC Prob3 Tight Family"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"050f6d05b2c94aea\" href=\"?note=050f6d05b2c94aea\" title=\"58-df-compact\">58-df-compact</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"29e8d6cd15d08f4f\" href=\"?note=29e8d6cd15d08f4f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-measure6-probability-measure\">58-df-zfc-measure6-probability-measure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fbf66bd653933f12\" href=\"?note=fbf66bd653933f12\" title=\"58-df-zfc-prob3-weak-convergence\">58-df-zfc-prob3-weak-convergence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-topology.md\">../batch14/58-df-topology.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> (underlying space)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> (topology)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\">\\(\\mathcal M\\)</span> (family of probability measures, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"29e8d6cd15d08f4f\" href=\"?note=29e8d6cd15d08f4f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-measure6-probability-measure\">58-df-zfc-measure6-probability-measure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B(E,\\tau)\">\\(\\mathcal B(E,\\tau)\\)</span> (Borel <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-algebra generated by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Top}\">\\(\\mathrm{Top}\\)</span> (topology predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-topology.md\">../batch14/58-df-topology.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compact}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\)</span> (compactness predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"050f6d05b2c94aea\" href=\"?note=050f6d05b2c94aea\" title=\"58-df-compact\">58-df-compact</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6ProbabilityMeasure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6ProbabilityMeasure}_S\\)</span> (probability-measure predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb3TightFamily}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb3TightFamily}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob3\\text{-}tight\\text{-}family}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcProb3TightFamily}_S(E,\\tau,\\mathcal M)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,E)\\land\\left[\\forall\\mu\\in\\mathcal M\\;\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6ProbabilityMeasure}_S(E,\\mathcal B(E,\\tau),\\mu)\\right]\\land\\forall\\varepsilon&gt;0\\;\\exists K\\subseteq E\\;\\left(K\\in\\mathcal B(E,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S(K,\\{U\\cap K:U\\in\\tau\\})\\land\\forall\\mu\\in\\mathcal M\\;(\\mu(E\\setminus K)&lt;\\varepsilon)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob3\\text{-}tight\\text{-}family}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcProb3TightFamily}_S(E,\\tau,\\mathcal M)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,E)\\land\\left[\\forall\\mu\\in\\mathcal M\\;\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6ProbabilityMeasure}_S(E,\\mathcal B(E,\\tau),\\mu)\\right]\\land\\forall\\varepsilon&gt;0\\;\\exists K\\subseteq E\\;\\left(K\\in\\mathcal B(E,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S(K,\\{U\\cap K:U\\in\\tau\\})\\land\\forall\\mu\\in\\mathcal M\\;(\\mu(E\\setminus K)&lt;\\varepsilon)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Requiring the compact witness to be Borel makes every term <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu(E\\setminus K)\">\\(\\mu(E\\setminus K)\\)</span> defined even without an ambient Hausdorff assumption.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-compact","status":"resolved","id":"050f6d05b2c94aea","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-compact]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-measure6-probability-measure","status":"resolved","id":"29e8d6cd15d08f4f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-measure6-probability-measure]]","embed":false},{